115
00:08:49,540 --> 00:08:54,240
All right, so this is something we often say when we have a long project or plan.

116
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:58,920
You can say, yes, things are good now, but this is just the beginning.

117
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:01,420
