124
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,080
So take the lead, be in the front.

125
00:09:45,180 --> 00:09:51,520
So basically the phrase to lead the way is for you to be in the front and give people a clear path.

126
00:09:52,020 --> 00:09:54,970
Think of Usain Bolt, that runner in the Olympics.

127
00:09:55,310 --> 00:09:58,170
Everyone's running quickly, but all of a sudden he takes the lead.

128
00:09:58,370 --> 00:09:59,530
He leads the way.

129
00:09:59,530 --> 00:10:01,610
He is ahead of everyone else.

130
00:10:01,810 --> 00:10:03,870
