133
00:10:10,950 --> 00:10:13,030
We cannot let our customers down, basically.

134
00:10:13,310 --> 00:10:15,890
So the phrase here is to let someone down.

135
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:17,410
He let me down.

136
00:10:17,750 --> 00:10:18,990
We let them down.

137
00:10:19,350 --> 00:10:21,470
This is a great phrase and you can use it about anybody.

138
00:10:22,300 --> 00:10:25,870
And it's a really important phrase because it means to disappoint someone.

139
00:10:26,410 --> 00:10:30,970
So for example, Marco, when you forgot my birthday, you really let me down.

140
00:10:31,290 --> 00:10:44,240
Okay, so that means I disappointed you because I forgot your birthday. So to let someone down is to disappoint them, to not do what you were expected to do.

141
00:10:44,460 --> 00:10:46,540
Exactly. And so a company can do this.

142
00:10:46,820 --> 00:10:53,740
For example, when a company like Toyota makes a car that has many problems, that company lets down its customers.

143
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,920
So you can let someone down.

144
00:10:56,040 --> 00:10:57,340
Basically, you have to have the subject.

145
00:10:57,620 --> 00:11:02,580
You let someone down or the company let down its customers.

146
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:03,160
